---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="About AutoPet | How we review pet tech" description="Learn about AutoPet's practical, independent approach to reviewing smart pet gadgets.">
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little more about us</p>
    <h1>Useful tech should make care feel easier.</h1>
    <p class="lead">AutoPet helps pet people make informed decisions about the gadgets they bring home. We focus on how products fit into daily care—not on features for their own sake.</p>
    <h2>How we approach reviews</h2>
    <p>Our guides compare practical details such as setup, meal scheduling, cleaning, ongoing costs, and limitations. We aim to separate helpful conveniences from claims that deserve a closer look. Products are not veterinary care, and our guides are not a substitute for advice from your animal's care team.</p>
    <p>Some links may earn AutoPet a commission if you purchase. This does not change the price you pay or our editorial conclusions. Read our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.</p>
    <h2>Questions or corrections?</h2>
    <p>We welcome thoughtful feedback. <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: auto; padding-block: 3rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 750; }
  h1 { max-width: 15ch; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .lead { color: var(--muted-ink); font-size: 1.25rem; }
</style>
